// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Bassie_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PayUp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1131690206" "A bill for Archon Dekker"
// DetailString :
"P11952756" "This is a long list of Archon Dekker's gambling debts. It's pretty impressive. At the bottom, under Basse Croupier's signature, are a few words from Johnny Sonata himself: <br><br>'Don't be a cheapskate, Dekker. Nobody likes it, and I guaruntee that they'll be worse to come. <br>-Johnny Sonata'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P317044530" "People today, man, I just don't get 'em. It's like everybody's changing into something else. It's all crazy. And sometimes, it makes 'em do crazy things. Case in point: <br>There's this guy, one a them Council types called Archon Dekker. Well, he racks up a whole lot of gambling debts, and we tell him he's gotta pay. Then he goes and gets himself turned into some kinda half alien thing called a 'Galaxy Soldier'. Now he thinks he's a different person, so he says he ain't got to pay up his old debts, man. Me, I'm all for personal reinvention and all, but that's just being cheap. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So, I'd like you to remind this Archon Dekker that he still has bills to pay.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1354098372" "Remind Archon Dekker to pay up."
// SendOffString :
"P3813015323" "This one might be tense, man, but don't let it get to you. Just teach Dekker his lesson, all personal like. Give him this note, too. Just to remind him how much he owes, you know, and give him a little more encouragement. Oh, and keep your eyes peeled. Those Council guys may have patrols and stuff walking around."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2632783963" "Tell Archon Dekker to pay up."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P764022924" "Just teach Dekker his lesson, all personal like. Give him this note, too. Just to remind him how much he owes, you know, and give him a little more encouragement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4138244370" "Even in the Rogue Isles, the Council still likes to live underground."

